Rule 2 (Tensor dimension compatibility for broadcasting when they have the same rank)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1
